---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Loan Programs">
  <section class="py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-cyan/10 to-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6">Loan Programs</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">No matter your situation, there's a path to homeownership. Here are the programs I specialize in.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div id="fha" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-magenta mb-4">FHA Loans</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">Perfect for first-time buyers with limited savings.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> As low as 3.5% down payment</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Credit scores as low as 580</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Flexible debt-to-income ratios</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Gift funds accepted for down payment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div id="va" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-magenta mb-4">VA Loans</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">Exclusive benefits for veterans and active military.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> 0% down payment required</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> No private mortgage insurance (PMI)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Competitive interest rates</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> More lenient credit requirements</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div id="usda" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-magenta mb-4">USDA Loans</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">0% down for homes in eligible rural and suburban areas.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> 100% financing (0% down)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Low mortgage insurance costs</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Available in many suburban areas</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Income limits apply</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div id="dpa" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-magenta mb-4">Down Payment Assistance</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">Programs to help cover your down payment and closing costs.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Grants (no repayment required)</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Forgivable second mortgages</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> State and local programs</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Can be combined with FHA, VA, or conventional loans</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div id="conventional" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-magenta mb-4">Conventional Loans</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">Flexible options with competitive rates for qualified buyers.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> As low as 3% down for first-time buyers</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> PMI can be removed at 20% equity</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Higher loan limits than FHA</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Best rates for strong credit</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div id="dscr" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-magenta mb-4">DSCR Loans (Investors)</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">For real estate investors purchasing rental properties.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Qualify based on rental income, not personal income</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> No tax returns required</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Purchase or refinance</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Multiple properties allowed</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div id="bank-statement" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-magenta mb-4">Bank Statement Loans</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">Perfect for self-employed borrowers.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Use bank statements instead of tax returns</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> 12 or 24-month bank statements</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Higher income calculations</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Ideal for business owners</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div id="manufactured" class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-magenta mb-4">Manufactured Home Loans</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 mb-6">Financing options for manufactured housing.</p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-gray-600">
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> FHA and conventional options available</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Low down payments</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Competitive rates</li>
            <li class="flex items-start"><span class="text-primary-cyan mr-2">✓</span> Must meet HUD standards</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-magenta to-pink-600 text-white rounded-2xl p-12 text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Not Sure Which Program Is Right for You?</h2>
        <p class="text-xl mb-8 text-pink-100">Let's talk! I'll review your situation and find the best fit.</p>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/dennisfieldsmortgagepro" target="_blank" class="inline-block bg-white text-primary-magenta px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-all">
          Schedule Free Consultation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
